<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-ardĕo</span></b> , ēre,
		2, v. a. (eccl. Lat.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop., <i>to burn</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sir. 16, 7</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">ib. 28, 14</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">27</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of the feelings, <i>to
				be inflamed</i>, <i>blaze out</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in brevi ira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Psa. 2, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in desideriis suis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rom. 1, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
